# the Doom demo over a party (issue #75 part B; make poc-doom; looked up live on 2026-11-04): Odamex 12.3.0 (GPL-2.0-or-later, the
# latest stable release; the source tarball's SHA-256 is the one GitHub shows for the asset), Freedoom 0.13.0 (BSD-3-Clause; freedoom2.wad is the
# game data: no doom.wad, no doom2.wad), on a Debian 13 base pinned by digest. The image is built once (poc/doom/build.sh), cached in $CACHE
# under a name that carries the hash of everything that goes into it, and loaded into the players' nodes (no registry, no pull).
DOOM_DEBIAN_IMAGE=docker.io/library/debian:trixie-slim@sha256:f6b08b09a05725f9431502d3b5714f5c4576e82c1a84fa1debe0c24a7e0c3ec4
DOOM_ODAMEX_VERSION=12.3.0
DOOM_ODAMEX_SHA256=aeccf1aff5c7de17365aa764c2fe64e0ecaf16fa43f8389061f7a593fbe932cb
DOOM_FREEDOOM_VERSION=0.13.0
DOOM_FREEDOOM_SHA256=3f9b264f3e3ce503b4fb7f6bdcb1f419d93c7b546f4df3e874dd878db9688f59
